Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:05.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不做猎人了  我找到了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't hunt anymore. I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她叫什么  -艾米利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was her name? - Amelia!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我不当猎人的那一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, the year that I took off,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.46,0:00:09.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拥有了我从没有过的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had something I've never had.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy Birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正常人的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}A normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.11,0:00:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直在炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in Purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我觉得纯粹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么逃出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how'd you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.70,0:00:20.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我有你想要的东西 -什么东西 \N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got something you need. - Yeah, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:21.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带你找到门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I show you the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:24.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把我的灵魂带过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you hump my soul to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功了  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小卡呢  他也在那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Cass? Was he there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:30.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在下面出了点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened to him down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.21,0:00:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有你我不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving here without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.65,0:00:37.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文·谭  上帝的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin Tran, Prophet of the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.45,0:00:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名号不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does have a nice ring to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.79,0:00:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-上面说什么  -劝我们别去追\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. What's it say? - That we shouldn't come looking,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然我们没了石碑  凯文觉得我们不需要他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and since we lost the tablet, Kevin figures we don't need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:45.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是克劳力还用得上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but Crowley still does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:48.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:01:00.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(华盛顿州  伊格尔港)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.21,0:01:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  昆丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Quentin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.51,0:01:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:24.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不可能是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-it -- it can't be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能理解你的困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:31.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心里最清楚  我绝对是死翘翘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You of all people knew I was really, truly dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.98,0:01:34.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟当时你还摁着我的腿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, you held down my legs, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:38.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而老爸则让索兰托把我的头锯下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the old man told Sorento to saw off my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.61,0:01:43.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:49.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为我会告诉你他在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really think I'd tell you where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.61,0:01:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  我就希望你不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess I was kind of hoping you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.05,0:02:00.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  我也可以带你去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand, I might show you where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:05.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们得先剁掉你的四肢\N{\fnArial\fs30}After me and my boys take off your hands and feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可别为我这么大费周章啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't go through all that trouble on my account.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:12.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从上帝的屁股底下爬出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go and crawl your way out of God's ass
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.94,0:02:14.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是来坐旋转木马的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}for another ride on the merry-go-round?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:18.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸肯定想亲眼看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man's gonna want to see this for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.02,0:02:25.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也许有本事杀掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they might be able to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.23,0:02:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.03,0:02:32.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很清楚我死后会去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause if they do, I know exactly where I'm going...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.26,0:02:35.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有在那里会遇到什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and who I'll see when I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:40.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第8季第5集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(俄勒冈州  伊尼德)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:56.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.14,0:03:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这是耍我们两次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is twice that he's burned us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.69,0:03:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你丢人吧  -你少来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shame on you. - No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.57,0:03:05.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我说他给我们下了套\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who said he set us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.83,0:03:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对  你说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.57,0:03:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"不知这是不是凯文的圈套"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I wonder if Kevin is setting us up,"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:10.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后你就开始说那些无聊的技术问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you started in with the -- the techno babble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.66,0:03:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是在上上个州的时候  \N{\fnArial\fs30}That was like two states ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.94,0:03:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.47,0:03:16.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个房间的付款人也是凯文的一个假身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's another room billed to one of Kevin's false credit I.D.s.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:18.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且汽车旅馆今天刷过他的卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the motel ran his number today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好像他真的入住了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like he actually checked in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:21.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子就像是雨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid's like Rain Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:23.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:26.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:26.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就像个会"数"信用卡的讨厌鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's like a crappy little credit-card-counting...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.78,0:03:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犯罪天才型雨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Criminal prodigy Rain Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.55,0:03:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可是跳级生呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he was in advanced placement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.51,0:03:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:36.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个小白痴什么时候能不躲我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's that little idiot gonna stop running from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:36.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.83,0:03:38.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当时可真要杀他妈妈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you did try to kill his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:43.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那是想杀死克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to kill Crowley, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:45.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过他当时附身在凯文妈妈身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who happened to be wearing Kevin's mother at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:47.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.35,0:03:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文显然不这么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently not to Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概因为  哦对  那是他妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know. Maybe because -- oh, yeah, -- it's his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:53.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等会儿再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:56.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是算了  你就打消那个念头吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually, you know what? Don't hold that thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:03:59.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.33,0:04:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍等  信号不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hang on. There's not enough bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:15.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:17.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:22.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有空吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, um -- you got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我搞砸了  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid I messed up, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  老兄  不是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man, not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:50.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说一次  你对付了几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. You took on how many?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你疯了吗  -别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you crazy? - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:59.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题在于  我的腿有点不灵便了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the thing is, my legs -- they ain't working so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.02,0:05:06.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,燃油驳船离得不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}a fuel barge not too far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.97,0:05:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定能慢慢爬过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure I can make it at a slow crawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我想再让你帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was kind of hoping maybe I could ask you for one more favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:19.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}And -- and what exactly is that supposed to mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.45,0:05:21.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么叫你必须走  -哪个词没听懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you've got to go? - Which words are giving you trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.66,0:05:23.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们手头有活儿呢  记得吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the case, remember, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.59,0:05:25.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特家的圣杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchester holy grail,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.06,0:05:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"永远关上地狱之门"大计\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Shut the gates of hell forever" case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.93,0:05:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  但是为了关上地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure are. But in order to close the Gates of Hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要先知  没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need our Prophet, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一步  找到凯文·谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}So step one -- find Kevin Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:34.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不在这里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he ain't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:35.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他把我们引到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he wanted us to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.91,0:05:38.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们肯定是在他能把我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means we're probably as far away from him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.11,0:05:39.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甩得最远的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}as he could possibly put us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:42.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么第二步  找到凯文·谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}So step two -- find Kevin Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,介意我拿走三角巧克力吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind if I take the Toblerone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:49.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  迪恩  你来真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Dean, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:51.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,线索断了  但是房费已经付了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, the trail is dead, but the room is paid for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.71,0:05:52.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有调查要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got some research to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:54.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我要处理一点私人的破事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got some personal crap I got to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:56.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-就这样吧  -什么叫"私人的"\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's all. - What does that mean -- "Personal"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:58.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你中风了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have a stroke?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:05:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话都听不懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vocabulary?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:02.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,私人的  就是说我一成年人个人的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personal, as in my own grown-up personal --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:04.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说呢  就是破事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know -- crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-见鬼  -怎么了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn it -- - What, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.31,0:06:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了  你休了一年没做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last I counted, you took a year off from the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.43,0:06:10.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只需要休一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:06:59.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(普林斯顿大学)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.48,0:07:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个卑鄙的兔子  谭先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a wascally wabbit, Mr. Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:02.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(卡斯卡迪亚信用合作社)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:17.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是跟踪  是关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not stalking...concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:23.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(艾米利亚·理查德森)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.51,0:08:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃弗雷特  老兄  你还在上班啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everett. Hey, buddy, you still on duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:04.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.89,0:08:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:08.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对新食谱不太适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's kind of having it rough on the new regimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.27,0:08:09.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃什么都吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't keep anything down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.85,0:08:11.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:12.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.99,0:08:15.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样  我打算再住一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, um, I'm gonna stay on another week, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过要用这张卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need you to run it on this card,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次登记的那张刚刚注销了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I just canceled the one you had on file.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为这会儿你该走了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured you'd have moved on by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:26.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个  我目前没工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Well, I'm -- I'm kind of between jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.41,0:08:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说狗狗周二还有个后续手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}plus, uh, Dog has a surgery follow-up on Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  这狗被你弄得挺惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you really messed up that dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:37.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是  多谢帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Uh, thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:41.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那东西就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, it's all that thing does --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.13,0:08:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,漏水  嗡嗡响  浪费我们的电费\N{\fnArial\fs30}piss, moan, and eat up money we ain't got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有工具吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got any tools?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:49.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是能修好它  就不用出去找工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, if you can fix it, you don't need to go and look for a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.07,0:08:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿干就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.35,0:09:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.56,0:10:24.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.45,0:10:29.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not lookin' good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:32.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. You, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气色不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}look okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.33,0:10:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:52.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  你刚才就跟废了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you were double-hamstrung.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍作休息  再来几包AB阴性血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, a little rest, a half a cooler full of AB-negative...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:11:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要没缺胳膊少腿  大部分伤都能痊愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}most wounds short of an amputation will mend up...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:02.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}vampirically speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.07,0:11:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快我就能完全恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be 100% before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.45,0:11:09.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:11.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼  怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.90,0:11:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该干的都干完了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, your work here is done, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:17.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能帮的都帮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already saved the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.61,0:11:21.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有我的事情  你有你的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I got my, uh, deal, and you got --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}what'd you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.11,0:11:22.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}A family business?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:24.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.48,0:11:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:33.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友义气真要命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and that whole "friend" thing, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我得承认他确实有两下子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got to admit, Dean -- he's got his strong points,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.30,0:11:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也太惹眼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but holy hell if he ain't a magnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没找到小卡之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, before we found Cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还嫌我的人肉味儿引人注意呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}you said it was my humanity that was drawing too much attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:57.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们暂时安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think we're clear for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:04.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玄学上讲来真是个有趣的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does present a curious curl in the metaphysics, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.47,0:12:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在妖怪天堂里杀妖怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you murder a monster in monster heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:07.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们会去哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}where does it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.15,0:12:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是跟我们一起上路的疯姨妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is the crazy aunt I want to take on the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.35,0:12:12.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是你姨妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not your aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:13.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:16.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和你的血族没有潜在亲缘关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no possible relationship to your sibling offspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:17.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开我心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.51,0:12:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩个折磨死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you two are killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.95,0:12:22.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得同意吸血鬼的说法  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to agree with the vampire, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:24.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冒险带炽天使逃出炼狱...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The risk of crossing Purgatory with a seraph --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.92,0:12:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相当不明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's...less than strategic,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.52,0:12:29.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,况且我们又没理由相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}and certainly when we have no reason to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.35,0:12:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能通过你们要走的那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I can pass through the door that you're headed for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.53,0:12:32.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看  你是深陷炼狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, you're an intact,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完好无损活生生的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}living human being stuck in Purgatory's craw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个空间想把你赶出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This dimension wants to spit you out,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.31,0:12:40.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们逃出生天的原动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is exactly what's gonna power our escape pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:42.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己肯定也能混出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm pretty sure I can squeeze through, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.05,0:12:45.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为不论如何  除了尖牙和吸血之乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}because, after all, you take away the fangs and the fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:47.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也曾经是个人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born human, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.31,0:12:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:51.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我恐怕不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it would work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.39,0:12:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到他说的了吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear what he's telling you, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.05,0:12:55.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥们他说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your buddy is saying --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我听着  你这吸血成瘾的不死族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, you undead blood junkie,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:13:00.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔法对我有效  计划我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one with the mojo. I'm the one with the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:01.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:04.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定会想办法让你穿过那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna shove your ass back through the eye of that needle
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.03,0:13:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在所不辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it kills all three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:09.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用说  我对此很不满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, I'm less than comfortable with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.49,0:13:12.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还这么死脑筋  真让我倍感安慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's good to know you're still dumb as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.42,0:13:15.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些事是不会变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, some things never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.22,0:13:18.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么跟同类挥起砍刀来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why are you getting into machete fights with your own kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.05,0:13:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昆丁  我来找的那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin, the one I came for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:24.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们原是一个巢穴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were in the same nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在追杀转化我的那个吸血鬼  我的创造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hunting the vampire who turned me, my maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.15,0:13:34.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:37.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我支持你杀他  可是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm down with the hunting, but, uh...why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.83,0:13:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先下手为强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him before he kills me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:42.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,免得我再遭殃\N{\fnArial\fs30}again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.98,0:14:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:12.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你还没下班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, if you're still on the clock,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,118的女士说她的水槽堵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}lady in 118 says the sink's backed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你这人不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew there was something off about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那堆吓人的陆海军装备  还有鬓角\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your creepy Army-Navy and your sideburns --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:30.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:32.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在帮你修水槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I'm fixing your sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.55,0:14:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和昆丁是老朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin and I went way back --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.03,0:14:43.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是老爸最喜欢的一个  仅次于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of the old man's favorites, next to me, it turns out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.97,0:14:49.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"水瓶座纪元二号  0800"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Age of Aquarius II, 0800,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.44,0:14:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后面还有数字  都划掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then there's some other numbers all crossed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.60,0:14:54.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有些奇怪的名字  "大美人鱼"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some other weird names here, too -- the Big Mermaid,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.11,0:14:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"红心大战"  也都划掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solitaire -- it's all crossed out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.89,0:14:57.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了这一个  "幸运玛拉"\N{\fnArial\fs30}except this one -- the Lucky Myra.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.99,0:14:59.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是游艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yachts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.76,0:15:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游艇的名字  幸运玛拉  水瓶座纪元二号 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Names of yachts -- Lucky Myra, Age of Aquarius II.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:07.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看这个  "洄见"多了三点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this one -- Sea You Later, spelled s-e-a.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:08.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该懂了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.89,0:15:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是出航时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, then these are launch times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:12.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what -- destinations?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:15.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  但这些艇都不会靠港了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. Except none of them ever get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:17.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸运玛拉昨天下午起航\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lucky Myra left yesterday afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.19,0:15:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以保证它已经遭袭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guarantee you it's already been hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"遭袭"是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "hit"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:25.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强行登船  焚毁  葬身海底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boarded, burned, and buried at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:27.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们巢穴用餐的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}My nest -- that's how we fed...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.67,0:15:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一向如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we always fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.81,0:15:34.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们养着一只小舰队  大概有六艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kept a tight little fleet, maybe a half-dozen boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.01,0:15:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外表并不招摇  只是普通游船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing ostentatious, just pleasure craft.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:40.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我航行的里程都够绕美洲十圈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have circled the Americas 10 times during my tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.64,0:15:42.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人专门扮成外乡人  在港口游荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few of us would act as stringers and patrol the harbors,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寻找合适的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for the right-size target --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些驶向很远的港口的豪华游轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}fat, rich yachts going to far-off ports.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:50.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记录下游轮的名字和目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take down the boat's name and destination,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再用无线电通知水上的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}radio it to the crew in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:54.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we just, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:58.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让海水淹没我们的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}let the ocean swallow up all our sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.88,0:16:05.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是吸血鬼海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampire pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你们是干这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you guys are?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:09.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸血海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:12.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起干了这么多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, all the years we ran together,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.16,0:16:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然从没有人想到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe nobody ever thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:17.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么啊  这个很容易想到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? It's like the third thing you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.37,0:16:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你的创造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, y-your maker
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:24.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备在这附近觅食对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is set up to feed around here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:26.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are we looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.81,0:16:28.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他生活一向很有范儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he likes to live in style.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.58,0:16:30.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他通常合法租下房屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He usually rents legitimately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏远而临海的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always remote, always coastal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.34,0:16:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是个小岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}So an island, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:36.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是有线电视收费单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a cable bill here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.83,0:16:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昆丁还包月了美国棒球联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Quentin's got the NFL package.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:41.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,普兰提斯岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prentiss Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.23,0:16:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:48.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你是创造者的心头肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so, if you were your maker's favorite,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.77,0:16:50.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么要杀死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}why did he kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:52.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你被转化的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you get turned,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.83,0:16:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你重新生在了一个吸血鬼巢穴中\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's like you're reborn into a vampire nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:58.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的创造者就是你的全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your maker -- he means everything to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:17:02.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会开始相信他就是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you really start believing he's God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:05.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你的创造者也是这么想的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if your maker happens to believe the same thing, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.85,0:17:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就成了问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how that could be a pickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.51,0:17:13.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你非要现在吸那个东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you really have to do that? I mean, right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:16.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:18.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉好多了  但还在恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm better, but I'm still on the mend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.02,0:17:19.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的父亲  他嫉妒心很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway...our father -- he was a jealous God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.85,0:17:26.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让家族成员住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept the family together
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:32.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在海上漂泊  远离外面的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}but kept us apart from the rest of the world, always at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.37,0:17:36.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做事一向以家族为先\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always did what was best for the nest...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到我遇见了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}till I met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:41.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.59,0:17:45.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚·科莫斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea Kormos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.98,0:17:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种无以言表的美  你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, words don't even cut it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:52.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希腊的名门之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greek, heiress.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她驾一艘单桅帆船前往加那利群岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was sailing a 42-foot sloop to the Canary Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本该把她的目的地告诉我的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I should have called her boat's destination in to my crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.36,0:18:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我却跟她上了船\N{\fnArial\fs30}but instead, I joined her on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:08.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.83,0:18:11.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算是什么三俗的桥段啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was Fabio on the cover of that paperback?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.03,0:18:17.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的生活从此因她而变  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life changed when she entered it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前我所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything I had been or done up to that point just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:24.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎都消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}seemed to vanish...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:27.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩下了我和她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into what we had become together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:31.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到了真爱  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean... We found it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.02,0:18:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后  我们在路易斯安那定居\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eventually, we settled in Louisiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.73,0:18:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后有天晚上  我们回到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then one night, we were coming home,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.93,0:18:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸就在那儿等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the old man -- he was just there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.88,0:18:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我的旧友昆丁  索兰托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quentin, Sorento, my oldest nestmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到那天晚上我才明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was only that night I understood
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.23,0:18:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的离开  在他看来多么不可饶恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}what a crime it was to him -- me leaving him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.98,0:19:00.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把我按在地上  接着斩首\N{\fnArial\fs30}They pinned me down, and they beheaded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到的最后一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last thing I saw
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.10,0:19:08.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是他咬破安德莉亚的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the old man tearing out Andrea's throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.23,0:19:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,报复不就是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's what payback's all about -- am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:18.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到码头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Docks are up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.93,0:19:21.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该能找到能用的小船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be able to find a dinghy to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.81,0:20:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.35,0:20:19.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(我在抓吸血鬼  老巢在普兰提斯岛)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.33,0:20:21.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind you of anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.75,0:20:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(删除)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.15,0:20:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到这个世界突然感觉怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's weird being back -- in the world, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:37.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:38.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure as hell is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么面对这一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what do you do with it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.57,0:20:45.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the -- all the everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:48.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道这世界是不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I don't even know if this world is real,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.08,0:20:50.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I'm real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.59,0:20:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.47,0:20:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我十分清楚这种心态的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see what happens down that rabbit hole, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.16,0:20:57.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.62,0:20:59.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼  这一切都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny, this is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.47,0:21:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要活下去必须这么想  懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way to play this game, you get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.76,0:21:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该走了  本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to move, Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.49,0:21:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸的大键琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man's harpsichord.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:39.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.43,0:21:49.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:52.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.27,0:22:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.62,0:22:55.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想让我再杀你一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna make me do this all over again, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.84,0:22:57.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  索兰托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Sorento.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:03.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他转化了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He turned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:20.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在有点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.69,0:23:41.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩二号备用手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dean's other, other cell,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.54,0:23:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you must know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.12,0:23:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(德州驾照  艾米利亚·理查德森)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.20,0:23:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是干这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's what you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.87,0:23:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟踪无助的妇女\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stalk helpless women
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.80,0:23:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闯入她们的房间然后修她们的水管\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you break into their motel room and you fix their plumbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:24:00.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要修我的水槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you fixing my sink?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.43,0:24:03.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为有人丢了一大堆酸橙进去塞住了水管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, because somebody jammed about 800 limes down the drain...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.80,0:24:06.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,损坏了清理器\N{\fnArial\fs30}and blew out the disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.82,0:24:09.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  别碰我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Right. Don't touch the produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.49,0:24:10.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.33,0:24:11.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是要离开小镇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were leaving town.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.55,0:24:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我只是在帮着旅馆做维修\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am. I'm just helping out with maintenance at the motel,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.70,0:24:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃弗雷特他爸生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, while Everett's dad is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.77,0:24:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁是埃弗雷特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Everett?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.63,0:24:20.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这儿多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.86,0:24:23.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三个月  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three months. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.24,0:24:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一般人来到一个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, usually when someone moves into a town,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.77,0:24:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都会住到镇子里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}they actually, uh, you know, move into the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.52,0:24:31.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.08,0:24:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汽车旅馆可不算是小镇的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}A motel is not actually part of the town that it's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.24,0:24:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它那儿都不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not part of anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.17,0:24:41.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还没找到地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I haven't found a place yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.40,0:24:43.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要跟你解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I explaining myself to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.52,0:24:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个流浪汉或者杂务工\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a drifter or a handyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.41,0:24:47.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I think I should just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.59,0:24:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我觉得你该离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think you should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.08,0:25:05.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.91,0:25:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.90,0:25:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -你为什么打电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Why did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.95,0:25:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你小声说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you whispering?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.74,0:25:15.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解释起来有点复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of hard to explain,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.81,0:25:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我正忙着清理吸血鬼老巢呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm sort of in the middle of cleaning out a vampire's nest,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.59,0:25:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我情势有点不利\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's sort of gone a little sideways on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.58,0:25:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你是白痴吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! Are you an idiot, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.00,0:25:22.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没笨到一个人去吸血鬼老巢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know better than to go into a vamp nest alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.52,0:25:24.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是一个人  该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not alone, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.01,0:25:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了吗  我不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.44,0:25:27.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got backup --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.53,0:25:29.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙追查这伙人有一阵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}guy who's been tracking the nest for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.07,0:25:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪个家伙  盖思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What guy? Garth?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.89,0:25:32.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不  你不认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. You don't know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.97,0:25:34.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.01,0:25:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朋友  迪恩  你没有任何...\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend? Dean, you don't have any --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.82,0:25:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你所有的朋友都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all your friends are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.06,0:25:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打电话不是想跟你说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I called to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.53,0:25:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,索兰托  去  告诉老爸是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorento, go. Tell the old man it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.28,0:25:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He listens to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.05,0:25:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.94,0:25:55.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起索兰托  我们的父亲更相信我的判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father has come to trust my judgment over Sorento's.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.47,0:25:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只听命于他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I answer only to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.22,0:26:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和上帝上床必然是有好处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sleeping with God has got to have some perks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.09,0:26:10.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.81,0:26:15.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去看看老爸还需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure the old man has everything he needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.78,0:26:35.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.18,0:26:38.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到你回来了的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I heard you were back --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.03,0:26:40.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道为什么  我就知道是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know -- somehow, I knew it was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.78,0:26:44.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只能相信  期冀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to believe it, to hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.08,0:26:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚  发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.02,0:26:50.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸说他要吸干你的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man said he was gonna bleed you dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.58,0:26:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.50,0:26:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他改主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He changed his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.56,0:26:54.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我昏了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I blacked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.06,0:26:56.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒来时  我正从他手腕处吸血\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I woke up, I was drinking from his wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.32,0:26:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.85,0:27:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切都是因为我  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this is because of me. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.86,0:27:04.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  这不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.42,0:27:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼  你从未对我有任何隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never hid anything from me, Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.61,0:27:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我选择了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.70,0:27:13.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你为什么留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why'd you stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.10,0:27:17.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和他们在一起  和他一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}with them, with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.41,0:27:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.26,0:27:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也记得最初的情形\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember what it's like at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.51,0:27:26.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最初  一切都重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, everything resets.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.15,0:27:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活着就是吸血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life is blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.48,0:27:31.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不管是谁给了你血...  -我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And whoever gives it to you... - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.27,0:27:36.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.80,0:27:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事都很复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every damn thing is complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.05,0:27:44.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不一定非得如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.58,0:27:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.22,0:27:49.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼  我没法杀死他  我们都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny, I can't kill him -- none of us can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.37,0:27:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你  你死而复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you -- you came back from the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.70,0:27:56.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你证明了他不是万能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're proof that he's not all-powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.65,0:27:58.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he's not God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.60,0:28:01.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼  他怕你  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's scared of you, Benny -- I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.82,0:28:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我回来是为了摧毁他的觅食方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand that I came back to burn his operation to the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.05,0:28:14.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻止杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stop the killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.25,0:28:20.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做你要做的  我们就可以在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what you came for, and we can be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.87,0:28:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要我们带本尼过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants Benny brought to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.31,0:28:33.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们分开了一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the separate-lives thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.66,0:28:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这可是猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is a hunting thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.19,0:28:35.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得搞清这界限\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we need to find that line --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.49,0:28:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  别说了  我已经把地点发给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, stop talking. I texted you my 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.70,0:28:42.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到了  我这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got it. Look, I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.12,0:28:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  如果你们能处理好  那很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, listen, if you handle it, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.74,0:28:46.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会请你朋友喝一轮酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll buy your friend the first round.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.04,0:28:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  迪恩  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dean, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.67,0:28:49.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.90,0:28:52.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你在听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.30,0:28:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.84,0:28:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.12,0:29:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.40,0:29:07.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.09,0:29:25.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.12,0:29:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.17,0:29:30.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无话可说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no words.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.43,0:29:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别骗我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know that ain't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.15,0:29:37.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能给我们解释一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help us understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.07,0:29:40.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你不欠我们什么  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't owe us anything, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.33,0:29:43.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会活着  站在我面前呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you here, standing in front of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.31,0:29:45.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了一条回来的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.21,0:29:46.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.39,0:29:48.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据我所知  地狱在隔壁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right next door, as far as I could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.05,0:29:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隔壁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next door?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.47,0:29:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.29,0:29:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我大概只能让你亲眼见识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think I'll just have to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.61,0:30:00.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这么说不能改变什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it won't change anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.65,0:30:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我很后悔杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I regretted having you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.43,0:30:04.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切结束之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it was all done,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.16,0:30:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看着支离破碎的你  痛苦不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wailed when I saw you in all those pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.71,0:30:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是  索兰托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't I, Sorento?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.39,0:30:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是哭得像世上最丑的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't I wail like the ugliest baby in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.63,0:30:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.91,0:30:17.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是你决定转化他的婆娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when you decided to turn his cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.40,0:30:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的家伙充满怨念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor so-so is bitter
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.32,0:30:22.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你的"婆娘"地位比他高\N{\fnArial\fs30}because your "Cow" Outranks him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.44,0:30:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不让她死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you let her die?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.58,0:30:26.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她对你毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}She meant nothing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.52,0:30:28.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她是你的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she meant everything to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.26,0:30:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果唯一能从我任性的儿子那里挽回的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's all I could salvage from my wayward son --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.93,0:30:34.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个你为其抵抗你创造者的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the woman he defied his maker for --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.91,0:30:38.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要个能让我记得你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted someone to remember you by.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.68,0:31:00.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会知道生活的价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you know about the value of life?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.79,0:31:01.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.81,0:31:02.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.85,0:31:04.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们都清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think we both know
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.41,0:31:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁的同类杀死了更多人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}which of our kinds kills more humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.27,0:31:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从统计学来说  是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, statistically speaking, that'd be your --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.11,0:31:09.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  谢谢你  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, thank you, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.21,0:31:11.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.73,0:31:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是担心如果我们上去了  我会做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're worried what I might do if we make it topside.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.57,0:31:16.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怕我会吃你的小猪猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll start eating your little piggies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.99,0:31:19.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经告诉过你  伙计  我被杀之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already told you, man -- by the time I got iced,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.87,0:31:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直严格靠输血和吸捐血为生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was strictly on blood transfusions, donated blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.19,0:31:25.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确不是捐给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not donated to me, I'll give you that,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.81,0:31:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我在黑市上花了大价钱买来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I paid good black-market scratch for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.68,0:31:31.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么  吸血鬼节食法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what is that? Like the vampire zone diet?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.94,0:31:33.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, all I'm saying
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.08,0:31:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始看到人性的光辉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is I started seeing something in humanity, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.20,0:31:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到一些不该被夺去的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that shouldn't be taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.75,0:31:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吸血  但不吸人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drink blood. I don't drink people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.64,0:31:40.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why the hell should I believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.90,0:31:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你信什么重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it matter what you believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.00,0:31:43.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就真那么蠢吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your head so far up your ass, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.53,0:31:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不知道我们已经完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't even realize we're already done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.95,0:31:47.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.80,0:31:52.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带着他这么惹眼的人  我们根本出不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are never gonna make it with him next to us glowing like a beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.37,0:31:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我提醒你谈好的条件吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I need to remind you of our deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.80,0:31:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你承诺过的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what you committed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.71,0:31:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会害死我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is gonna get us killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.04,0:31:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许有机会检验你的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may get to test that theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.44,0:32:02.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-又有怪物  -是利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- More monsters? - Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.96,0:32:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你不飞走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you blip out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.83,0:32:06.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们太近了  我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're too close. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.20,0:32:07.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.98,0:32:40.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  别去  狗狗  狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Dog, dog, dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.26,0:32:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要  狗狗  别烦那位愤怒的小姐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, dog, don't bother the...angry lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.85,0:32:47.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hey, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.68,0:32:49.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"狗狗"  你就这么叫它\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dog"? That's what you're calling him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.31,0:32:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确名副其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.57,0:32:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗狗在打抗生素吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Dog taking his antibiotics?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.35,0:32:59.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yes, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.12,0:33:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它好多了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's doing much better. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.47,0:33:09.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, um, I have to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.27,0:33:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我见过不少缝合的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen a lot of stitches in my time,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.59,0:33:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的技术真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you've got really good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.18,0:33:17.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.10,0:33:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  你觉得我很可怕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you think I'm creepy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.92,0:33:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的衣服都在军需用品店买  这是很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's creepy you buy all your clothing at army surplus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.15,0:33:27.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白人至上主义者就这样  \N{\fnArial\fs30}White supremacists do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.73,0:33:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得对  可我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.94,0:33:30.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四处流窜的连环杀手也这样  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Drifting serial killers do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.23,0:33:31.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.08,0:33:32.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就这么凭空出现  又行踪不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come from nowhere, you appear to be going nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.92,0:33:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还"见过很多缝合的伤口"\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you've "Seen a lot of stitches."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.88,0:33:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些都绝对让人毛骨悚然\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all pretty solid creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.25,0:33:53.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不知道该何去何从  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea where you're going, either, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.19,0:33:56.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.17,0:33:58.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.60,0:34:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为你没有可依靠的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's because you have no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.76,0:34:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无牵无挂  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, at all, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.75,0:34:13.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才会在这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's why you're... here in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.14,0:34:21.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有过一个牵挂的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to -- have someone, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.46,0:34:24.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过都过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.34,0:34:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.52,0:34:34.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对此也有体会  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what that's like, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.51,0:34:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是迪恩的二号替补...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dean's other, other...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.78,0:34:46.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你的起死回生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you coming back from the dead --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.57,0:34:50.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这绝对是叛变了  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, that's the definition of mutiny, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.15,0:34:58.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事让我觉得很疲惫\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of this has me feeling so...tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.35,0:34:59.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你本该放我一马的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.36,0:35:01.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是本尼  我什么都不会放\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Benny, I don't let things go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.90,0:35:02.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.06,0:35:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你活了这么久  却怎么几乎什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lived so long, how is it you have so little, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.24,0:35:11.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一架老大键琴和一窝土狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but a beat-up old harpsichord and nest of hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.49,0:35:13.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大海是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.93,0:35:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我还有安德莉亚  -你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I have Andrea. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.47,0:35:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没得到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.38,0:35:21.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least that much I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.12,0:35:25.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个蠢娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that dumb bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.97,0:35:37.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候有了这种身手\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the hell did you learn to fight like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.33,0:35:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,熟能生巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a lot of practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.43,0:35:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你就打算这么坐着  -你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just gonna sit there? - You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.42,0:35:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这儿待得太久了  本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been here so, so long, Benny,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.32,0:35:59.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见过的结局和花样不计其数\N{\fnArial\fs30}seen all the outcomes, all the patterns a trillion times.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.77,0:36:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都不值一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all means so little.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.14,0:36:07.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界就是座绝望的坟墓  没别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This universe is a pyramid of despair, nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.51,0:36:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺悲观啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.39,0:36:12.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟  我是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am evil, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.92,0:36:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我还有这点悲观保持我的本色\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I've had that much to keep me cold at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.97,0:36:17.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从来没有  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never had that, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.86,0:36:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凡事都要考虑  思量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything had to be thought about, considered.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.00,0:36:22.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏格拉底有云\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what Socrates said
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.42,0:36:24.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不加思考的人生不值得过\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a life unconsidered.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.63,0:36:25.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.16,0:36:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但就我们的本性而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what we have in us?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.15,0:36:30.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼  这不叫人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny, that's not life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.64,0:36:33.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一点你还是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you still don't get.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.96,0:36:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才总是痛不欲生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why it's always been so hard for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.62,0:36:38.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可怜的本杰明\N{\fnArial\fs30}my poor Benjamin.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.21,0:36:44.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.24,0:36:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我唯一还能从你那儿夺走的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the one last thing I can take from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.91,0:36:49.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.47,0:36:52.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  你做点什么  再来杀我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try, damn it. You try and kill me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.48,0:36:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个小虫子  这是我的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my story, you gnat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.18,0:36:55.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.16,0:36:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结局由我来选择  不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ends the way I choose, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.98,0:37:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起码我能让你看点新鲜的了  老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least I can finally show you something new, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.13,0:37:09.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个崭新的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.90,0:37:25.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.44,0:37:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.39,0:37:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪儿  本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where, Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.31,0:37:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.97,0:37:40.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪儿都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.95,0:37:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想离开  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not leaving here, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.38,0:37:53.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从没想要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you never were.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.47,0:37:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这儿什么都不缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have everything we need right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.78,0:38:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种觅食方式依然天衣无缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The operation is still perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.81,0:38:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以扬帆公海  一同掳掠\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can ride the high seas, plunder together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.98,0:38:11.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能过上梦寐以求的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can have the life we always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.95,0:38:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想把这儿烧成灰  一走了之\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I wanted was to leave a burning crater behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.67,0:38:24.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下对你的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to put your memory to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.51,0:38:26.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不只是回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.00,0:38:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼  我就在你眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny, I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.77,0:38:35.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I loved --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.92,0:38:38.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早已逝去\N{\fnArial\fs30}it ain't here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.01,0:38:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她早就被像我和如今的你这样的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was snuffed out a long time ago by monsters like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.11,0:38:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扼杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}like what you've become.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.22,0:38:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你现在比我强吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're better than me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.67,0:38:52.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.17,0:38:56.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们都该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're all damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.45,0:39:30.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么那么做  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you do it, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.14,0:39:34.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.45,0:39:36.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resurrect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.58,0:39:40.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把我的灵魂随便扔在哪个阴沟里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have drained my soul into any culvert,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.75,0:39:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不会有人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one would have been the wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.09,0:39:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在胡说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.13,0:39:46.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.48,0:39:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  我不知道我算个什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man... I don't know what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.90,0:40:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.45,0:41:10.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.44,0:41:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,久仰你的大名了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard a lot about you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.92,0:41:37.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看得出来你们两个有很多话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you two have a lot to talk about.
